1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
Petra costs seventy dollars. The Great Wall? Six. I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,100
Machu Picchu runs about forty-three dollars to enter.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,600
The Taj Mahal: about sixteen dollars for foreign visitors.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,000
Petra tops them all — around seventy for a single day.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,500
China's Great Wall? Forty-five yuan. About six dollars.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,100
One of the New Seven Wonders, for the price of lunch.

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,600
Double-tap if cheaper doesn't mean lesser.

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,200
Same bucket-list tier — a tenth of Petra's gate.

9
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,800
★ Expert Tip: go early and book online — cable cars sell out by midday.

10
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,600
So: is the Great Wall the best-value wonder on earth? Tell me I'm wrong.
